//! World-space transforms of probe joints on the original BigWorld
//! crab asset (`res/crab.visual` + `res/crab_walkforward.animation`),
//! evaluated with the reference D3DX path: the channel result at the
//! given frame (D3DXQuaternionSlerp / D3DXVec3Lerp /
//! D3DXMatrixRotationQuaternion), then world = local x parent over the
//! visual node tree. Every literal is the exact f32 the reference
//! arithmetic produces. Included only by `skeleton.rs` tests.

